<li style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Location Asset ID:</strong> Destination where the items will be placed. Enter the room designation (e.g., 3520J) and select the corresponding facility mapping from the auto-complete array list.</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top: 10pt; font-style: italic; color: #666;">*Note: Line items scaling above $5,000 threshold values require specific configurations in the 'Review Required' attribute block.</p>
