<p style="margin-bottom: 10pt; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #555;">All fields with an asterisk must match the structural configurations provided on the baseline vendor quotation matrix exactly.</p>
<div style="margin-bottom: 15pt;"><span style="font-weight: bold; color: #e21833; font-size: 11.5pt;">Type A: Goods</span> <span style="font-size: 10pt; color: #666;">(Physical Assets, Compute, Integration, AV Hardware)</span>
<ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 10.5pt;">
<li><strong>Item Description:</strong> Context matching vendor spec text notes exactly.</li>
<li><strong>Commodity / Spend Codes:</strong> Mapped via the <a style="color: #0056b3;" href="https://rhs.umd.edu/pcodes" rel="nofollow">Procurement Codes Chart</a>.</li>
