<h2 id="after" style="font-size: 14pt; color: #454545; font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; margin: 24px 0 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding-bottom: 4px;">Post-Submission Logging Steps</h2>
<p style="margin-bottom: 10pt;">The instance processing screen displays your official 10-digit Requisition identity handle (e.g., <code style="font-weight: bold; color: #242424; background: #eee; padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">REQ-XXXXXXXXXX</code>).</p>
<div style="background-color: #fff3f3; padding: 15px; border-left: 4px solid #e21833; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>Mandatory Tracking Requirement:</strong> You must immediately log this active REQ string profile inside the shared organizational databases below to ensure operational alignment:
<ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 8px 0 0 0; line-height: 1.7;">
<li><strong>Workday Purchases Sheet (Google Sheets Log):</strong> <a style="color: #0056b3; font-weight: bold;" href="https://rhs.umd.edu/wdpurchase" rel="nofollow">https://rhs.umd.edu/wdpurchase</a></li>
<li><strong>Smith IT Procurement Tracker (ServiceNow Catalog):</strong> <a style="color: #0056b3; font-weight: bold;" href="https://rhs.umd.edu/procurement" rel="nofollow">https://rhs.umd.edu/procurement</a></li>
